01:41.940 --> 01:48.180
actually deployed. That means attackers will have time-limited access, but they will have

01:48.180 --> 01:53.300
physical access to the device. And time-limited in this sense can already be in the order of days,

01:53.300 --> 01:59.460
so you can pull off quite a lot of nice hardware and firmware attacks during that time. And then

