device into a trustworthy state that's what we're trying to do that's why we need hardware security

02:47.300 --> 02:52.500
and of course once the tenant leaves the device you also want to make sure that you can return

02:52.500 --> 02:59.060
the device into a trustworthy state and you know there's many definitions of trustworthy but for

02:59.060 --> 03:03.820
For sure, what you want to avoid is some persistence.

03:03.820 --> 03:09.580
Persistence in firmware, persistence in flash or peripheral devices.

