24:09.100 --> 24:09.800
That's the goal.

24:09.800 --> 24:12.140
We want to execute something nice.

24:12.140 --> 24:16.940
And just to illustrate what's going on here,

24:16.940 --> 24:18.900
and just to illustrate that this is a theme,

24:18.900 --> 24:24.500
collected some of the other vulnerabilities that others have found for example here on the remotely

24:24.500 --> 24:32.420
exploitable sites there was a vulnerability in shim shim is a small bootloader project

